      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'Can I use WhatsApp screenshots in UAE court?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Yes. Screenshots of WhatsApp messages are admissible as evidence in UAE Personal Status Courts and civil courts. To strengthen admissibility, the screenshots should be notarised with metadata visible (sender number, timestamp, read receipt). Courts increasingly apply the 2025 Dubai Digital Evidence Guidelines, which recognise timestamp data, geolocation markers, and message metadata as standard digital evidence. A court-ordered technical extraction from the device provides the strongest authentication.',
      },
