        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'First: do not act as though you are divorced until the court registers the talaq. Second: preserve the message immediately, screenshot it with metadata visible and have it notarised as soon as possible. Third: if your husband does not register the talaq within 15 days, you can file at the Personal Status Court either to obtain judicial registration of the talaq or to initiate your own divorce proceedings on different grounds. Fourth: consult a UAE family lawyer before making any decisions about housing, finances, or travel.',
      },
