    {
      '@type': 'Question',
      name: 'How do I prove my husband divorced me by text?',
      acceptedAnswer: {
        '@type': 'Answer',
        text: 'Evidence of a WhatsApp or SMS divorce in UAE courts: (1) notarised screenshots showing the message content, sender number, timestamp, and read receipt; (2) court-ordered technical extraction from the phone by a court-appointed IT expert; (3) WhatsApp Business API message export; (4) witness testimony from anyone who saw the message. For SMS, your mobile operator can provide call and message records with a court order. Timestamped evidence is highly persuasive because it is harder to fabricate.',
